# Members of the gnome group that are never downloaded, one per line with the
# condition they are left out under. Anything another member actually depends
# on still arrives as a dependency.
#
# always   every desktop install
# slim     only with the slim desktop
#
# GNOME Software manages nothing here: Arch advises against the PackageKit it
# would need for pacman, so all it could show is Flatpaks, which Bazaar handles,
# and firmware, which GNOME Firmware handles.
# https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/PackageKit
always gnome-software
slim gnome-calendar
slim gnome-maps
slim gnome-contacts
slim gnome-font-viewer
slim gnome-characters
slim gnome-clocks
slim gnome-connections
slim gnome-music
slim gnome-weather
slim gnome-calculator
slim gnome-logs
slim gnome-text-editor
slim gnome-disk-utility
slim simple-scan
slim baobab
slim snapshot
slim epiphany
slim loupe
slim decibels
slim showtime
slim papers
